A modern, feature rich Android application built using Kotlin and Android Jetpack components. This app demonstrates clean architecture, media handling, and scalable Android development.

🚀 Features
• 📱 Clean and modern UI • 🎥 Video playback using ExoPlayer • 📸 Camera integration using CameraX • 🗂️ Local database using Room • 🖼️ Image loading with Glide • 📜 Smooth navigation across screens • 🔄 RecyclerView for dynamic lists

🛠️ Tech Stack
• Language: Kotlin • Architecture: MVVM • UI: XML Layouts • Database: Room • Media: ExoPlayer • Camera: CameraX • Image Loading: Glide

📂 Project Structure
com.example.togalugombe

ui/ → Activities and UI logic data/ → Database and models adapter/ → RecyclerView adapters utils/ → Helper classes

⚙️ Setup Instructions
Clone the Repository
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/TogaluGombe.git

Or Download ZIP
Go to the repository on GitHub
Click Code
Click Download ZIP
Locate the downloaded ZIP file
Right click the file
Select Extract Here or Extract to folder
Open the extracted folder
Import into Android Studio
Open Android Studio
Click Open
Select the extracted project folder
Wait for Gradle sync to finish
Click Run to launch the app
